### Variant 8: English field names
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?limit=1
Accept-Language: en

### Variant 8: Russian field names
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?limit=1
Accept-Language: ru

### Regional and weighted language preferences
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books?limit=1
Accept-Language: en;q=0.2,ru-RU;q=0.9
